<title>FRANCE: Renault shares rise sharply.</title>
<headline>Renault shares rise sharply.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Renault rose sharply on Wednesday, with brokers pointing to Morgan Stanley as a buyer.</p>
<p>The stock was up 4.3 percent at 147.90 francs at 1045 GMT.</p>
<p>A Morgan trader said the share was part of a basket of stocks bought by the brokerage firm.</p>
<p>Renault's industrial vehicles unit Renault VI will report its 1996 results this afternoon and hold a news conference.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
